    <briefdescription>
<para>Reflection utilities for the µTest++ testing framework. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <computeroutput>reflection</computeroutput> namespace provides facilities for obtaining source location information and type names at compile time, thereby supporting advanced reporting and diagnostics within the µTest++ framework.</para>
<para>It includes a local implementation of <computeroutput><ref refid="classmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1reflection_1_1source__location" kindref="compound">source_location</ref></computeroutput> for environments lacking C++20 standard support, as well as utilities for extracting concise type names from compiler-specific macros such as <computeroutput>__PRETTY_FUNCTION__</computeroutput>.</para>
<para>All definitions within this namespace are intended to facilitate advanced reflection and reporting capabilities. </para>
